{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joie-serina-elephant-duo-swivel-baby-swing-2603-0090","content_id":"043dddae-c24d-48c5-84fa-856a564f0e3b","description":"Product Recall for Joie Serina Elephant Duo Swivel Baby Swing presenting a risk of injuries. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"b7c82d4a-87bf-4f7a-b2e8-a41aab9da0fa","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-27T15:05:20+00:00","id":"b7c82d4a-87bf-4f7a-b2e8-a41aab9da0fa","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-27T15:05:20+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c69cb0471d520038d0f7c8/2603-0090-product-recall-joie-serina-swivel-baby-swing.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Joie Serina Elephant Duo Swivel Baby Swing</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of injuries because the steel bolt, which secures the seat unit to the frame, can separate and cause the swing seat part to detach. This could lead to the infant receiving injuries.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Allison Baby UK Limited.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Childcare articles and children’s equipment - Baby Bouncing Cradles/Rocker Seats (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Joie</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>Elephant Duo W1306DAELD000</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5056080615509</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch Codes</td>\n      <td>190225, 200225, 210225, 220225</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Multi-motion electric baby swing sold via Joiebaby.com and Smyths Toys. For guidance on identifying batch dates, please see Annex A in the linked PDF.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_b7c82d4a-87bf-4f7a-b2e8-a41aab9da0fa\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c69cb0471d520038d0f7c8/2603-0090-product-recall-joie-serina-swivel-baby-swing.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of injuries because the steel bolt, which secures the seat unit to the frame, can separate and cause the swing seat part to detach. This could lead to the infant receiving injuries.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Allison Baby UK Limited.  </p>\n\n<p>We recommend that you stop using the product immediately and contact Joie Customer Care to arrange a refund or replacement via: <a href=\"mailto:customerservices.uk@joiebaby.com\">customerservices.uk@joiebaby.com</a>  or 0800 952 0061. </p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://joiebaby.com/uk/product-updates\">https://joiebaby.com/uk/product-updates</a> and <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.smythstoys.com/uk/en-gb/product-information\">smythstoys.com/uk/en-gb/product-information.</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0090, 2603-0097</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-27T15:06:20Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-27","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-27T15:06:20+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joie-serina-elephant-duo-swivel-baby-swing-2603-0090","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joie-serina-elephant-duo-swivel-baby-swing-2603-0090","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joie-serina-elephant-duo-swivel-baby-swing-2603-0090","content_id":"043dddae-c24d-48c5-84fa-856a564f0e3b","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-27T15:06:20Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Joie Serina Elephant Duo Swivel Baby Swing (2603-0090)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-joie-serina-elephant-duo-swivel-baby-swing-2603-0090","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type",